  "goodToKnow": "Der Wahlsieg is an election victory: ein knapper Wahlsieg (narrow), ein Erdrutschsieg (landslide). Its opposite is die Wahlniederlage. In Germany's proportional system, the party with the most votes doesn't automatically govern: it needs a majority coalition in the Bundestag. Related: der Wahlkampf (campaign), der Wahlabend (election night). Plural: die Wahlsiege."
